---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Read the Antons Blocked Drains Hills District privacy policy covering contact details, drainage job information, website data and privacy enquiries.">
  <article class="legal-page"><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Last updated 21 October 2026.</p><h2>Who We Are</h2><p>Antons Blocked Drains Hills District is provided by {site.operator}.</p><h2>Information You Provide</h2><p>If you call us, we may collect the contact and job information needed to respond, quote or provide drainage services. This may include your name, phone number, service address, access details and information about the blocked drain.</p><h2>How Information Is Used</h2><p>Information is used to respond to enquiries, arrange attendance, perform services, maintain business records and meet legal obligations. We do not claim to sell personal information.</p><h2>Website Data</h2><p>Google Analytics and our hosting provider may process technical and usage information, such as browser and device details, pages viewed and interactions with this website, to help us understand site use and deliver the service. We do not intentionally send names, service addresses or drainage-enquiry details to Google Analytics. Google describes its data practices in its <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer">Privacy Policy</a>.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, call <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phoneDisplay}</a>.</p></article>
</BaseLayout>
